<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Operation Bayern, 1965</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;Tanzania became independent of Great Britain in the early 1960s.&amp;nbsp; Its President,&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt; Julius Nyerere, believed socialism was the best path for his country.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;T&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;his scenario assumes that the Soviet Union replaced Nyerere with a puppet leader they could control and set about turning Tanzania into a militarized "African Cuba."&amp;nbsp; With an ally like this in&amp;nbsp;East Africa, the Soviets&amp;nbsp;believed they could more easily influence events in the&amp;nbsp;Indian Ocean, the Persian Gulf, and the Middle East.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;President Johnson considers this unacceptable.&amp;nbsp; However, rather than just wait for&amp;nbsp;Tanzania to become a new Soviet fortress in the Third World, Johnson intends to nip the problem in the bud.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;-------------------------------------------------------&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;"Bayern" is simply the code name for the operation. It was chosen randomly.&amp;nbsp; It has nothing to do with the German region of Baveria.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;A delta template .ini file has been included in the .zip file to assist in updating the scenario to any future versions of the database.&amp;nbsp; &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;Scenario Author: Mark Gellis&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
